      "spam": false,
      "value": "This one is kind of old but wanted to add my little bits here.\n\nFull Body tracking (1 on the hip and 1 on each foot, plus two controllers and 1 HMD.  Vive.)   This results in the eye tracking and blinking no longer functioning for other people.  \n\nIt still works for the user in the mirror and looks OK.\n\nNo one else can see it.\n\nTaking the exact same model and using it without the hip or feet trackers (Just the HMD and the two controllers) allows the Eye tracking and blinking to function again for other people.\n\nThanks!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
