      "spam": false,
      "value": "I would also add some info\n\nOthers can see eyes tracking when i change avatar and it's in Tpose just before i attach myself to it, after attaching eye tracking stops. I can see eyes moving for me in mirror but nobody else can.\n\nIt would be awesome if this could be fix, eye tracking make avatars feel much more alive, they looks soulless without it",
