  "details": "Eye tracking is broken when in full body tracking mode.\n\nIn the current release client eye tracking only works when in calibration mode.\n---\nIn the beta (as of 03/10/2017) Eye tracking… kinda works. In specific cases.\n\nWorking:\n\nfull body local (viewed in mirror)\nstandard local\nstandard remote (viewed by others)\n\n---\n\nNot working:\n\nfull body remote\nfull body calibrate",
